  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Manage > Receive goods, services and issue payments",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN applies to all central government departments including their executive agencies and non departmental public bodies (collectively referred to as 'in-scope organisations').",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN restates the policy on prompt payment for central government and sets our reporting requirements on prompt payment. In-scope organisations are to report their performance in connection with the payment of invoices by:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "a) publishing the percentage of invoices paid within (i) 5 days and (ii) 30 days, on a quarterly basis",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "b) publishing all interest liable, under the late payment legislation (referring to the Late Payment of Commercial Debts (Interest) Act 1988), on a quarterly basis.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Mystery Shopper service (now referred to as the Public Procurement Review Service or PPRS) will assist in ensuring contracting authorities comply with the above measures. The PPRS will also proactively ensure that 30 day payment terms are being passed down the supply chain.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Invoices should be paid promptly, with reporting on payment performance conducted quarterly in accordance with this PPN (i.e. PPN 05/15).",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In-scope organisations should:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure sufficient processes are in place to report on payment performance in accordance with the requirements of this PPN (i.e. PPN 05/15).",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework, including but not limited to, the following provisions of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (which may be particularly relevant to the consideration of this PPN):",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 113: Payment of undisputed invoices within 30 days by contracting authorities, contractors and subcontractors",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the PPN and any supporting implementation guidance",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prompt payment and performance reporting",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
